note for test at the latch with K above 4095 and no register free at the latch (14 names in the body): the
note latch falls back to B head; 5000 passes, s = sum of i + 14 (exit 0); error 12 or a wrong pass count fails
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 5000
a1 = add i 1
a2 = add a1 1
a3 = add a2 1
a4 = add a3 1
a5 = add a4 1
a6 = add a5 1
a7 = add a6 1
a8 = add a7 1
a9 = add a8 1
a10 = add a9 1
a11 = add a10 1
a12 = add a11 1
a13 = add a12 1
a14 = add a13 1
s = add s a14
end
ret int sub s 12567500
end
